  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nairobi: Cyber data protection &#x2013; a study on (In)security in Kenya&apos;s Cyber-Space integration of artificial intelligence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the Cyber data protection project is to execute a study on the security of Kenya&apos;s Cyber-Space integration of artificial intelligence. This is currently very relevant as both the private and public sectors are starting to incorporate artificial intelligence in their work. The proper use of artificial intelligence and protection of cyber data is therefore important for the future development of the tech-sector and tech legislation in Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
